# Yenna, Redtooth Regent {2}{G}{W}, a 4/4: "{2}, {T}: Choose target enchantment you control that doesn't have the same name as another
# permanent you control. Create a token that's a copy of it, except it isn't legendary. If the token is an Aura, untap Yenna, then scry
# 2. Activate only as a sorcery." Bot1 casts Yenna on turn one. On turn three Bot1 puts a Pacifism on Bot2's Ornithopter and copies it:
# the token Aura enters enchanting a creature Bot1 chooses (CR 303.4f), Bot2's Ornithopter again, so it is Pacified twice. Yenna untaps,
# and Bot1 scries 2: the Mountain stays on top and the Forest goes to the bottom of Bot1's library.

